        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0009-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T19:16:15.078+09:00"/>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T17:57:39.903+09:00">【1.2.1】 最初创造生命的【《吕氏春秋•大乐》云：“始生人者，天也，人无事焉。"】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T19:18:39.435+09:00">"本生"，即以"生"为本。本篇强调养生之道，乃在顺应天性。"生"与"性"两字古多通用，养生之道，乃在保存天性，其方法即为以物养生，而不能以生养物。作者强调"生"与"物"的关系，倡言重生轻物。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:13:53.078+09:00">能够护养上天创造的生命而不加违戾的人可称为天子。 【攖：戾也，违戾、违背之意。原文作“能养天之所生而勿接之谓天子"，《太平御览》卷七十七引此文作“能养天之所生而勿缨之谓之天子”。此文宜本作“能养天之所生而勿撰之之谓天子”。《御览》引文“之谓”误作“谓之”，今据改。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:10:45.686+09:00">都是以顺应自然、保全生命为前提的， 【全：依顺。天：天性。故：事。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:14:00.115+09:00">设置官职(由他们协助自己执政)，正是天子保全生命的方法。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T20:09:31.258+09:00">是天， 【CH： like Chen Qiyou and Wang Liqi this edition reads 天地 as a mistake for 天. This does make the text more conventionally alligned with several parallel texts, but  the traditional editions very largely agree on reading 天地。 The omission of 地 remains no more than a plausible conjecture.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:08:42.276+09:00">而养育生命并令它成长的</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:08:48.229+09:00">则是人；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:09:09.939+09:00">天子的一举一动</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:10:53.469+09:00">所以天子设立不同的官职。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:14:15.338+09:00">如今世上昏庸糊涂的君主，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:14:40.693+09:00">大量设立官职，反而伤害了自己的生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:14:51.446+09:00">这样便失去了设立官职的本意了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:16:29.765+09:00">譬如训练军队</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:16:58.627+09:00">是为了防备盗贼的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:17:09.245+09:00">可是如今练兵</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:17:37.833+09:00">这也就失去了训练军队的本来意义了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:24:50.704+09:00">【1.2.2】 水本来是清澈的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:24:55.566+09:00">为泥土所浊乱，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:25:00.421+09:00">就变得混浊不清。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:25:10.159+09:00">人本来可以长寿的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:25:14.108+09:00">但为物欲所扰乱，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:25:19.044+09:00">便无法得到长寿。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:25:33.507+09:00">外物</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:25:36.718+09:00">本来是用来供养生命的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:28:44.367+09:00">不应该耗损生命去追求它。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:33:59.995+09:00">然而今世糊涂的人</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:34:59.276+09:00">宁愿劳役自己的生命去追求外物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:35:15.036+09:00">这样做便是不知轻重了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:35:28.106+09:00">不知轻重，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:35:35.343+09:00">就会把重的当成轻，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:35:41.238+09:00">把轻的当成重。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:35:49.267+09:00">像这样，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:36:01.831+09:00">无论做什么事都不可能成功。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:36:50.917+09:00">抱着这种态度去当君主，便会惑乱糊涂；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:36:54.95+09:00">做人臣，便会败乱纲纪；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:37:13.156+09:00">做人子，便会狂放无礼。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:37:34.715+09:00">这三种情况，只要有其中一种存在，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:38:21.529+09:00">国家就无可幸免，必至灭亡。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:41:26.965+09:00">【1.2.3】假如有这样一种声音：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:42:09.87+09:00">耳朵听了甚觉惬意，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:42:23.692+09:00">然而听后使人耳聋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:42:42.451+09:00">人们一定不会去听。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:47:10.85+09:00">假如有这样一种颜色：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:47:18.528+09:00">眼睛看了甚觉愉快，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:47:26.104+09:00">然而看后使人眼盲，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:47:31.992+09:00">人们一定不会去看。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:47:44.519+09:00">假如有这样一种味道：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:50:21.949+09:00">人们吃到甚感满足，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:50:31.061+09:00">然而吃后使人口哑，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:50:35.019+09:00">人们一定不会去吃。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:50:59.42+09:00">因此，圣人对于声音、颜色、滋味的态度是：</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:51:09.172+09:00">有利于生命的便取用，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:51:21.648+09:00">伤害生命的便舍弃，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:51:30.229+09:00">这才是保全生命的方法。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:52:01.566+09:00">世上许多富贵的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:52:06.143+09:00">大都迷惑于声色滋味。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:52:17.128+09:00">他们日夜谋求这些东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:52:46.705+09:00">一旦幸而取得，即纵情其中而不能自制。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-05T21:53:43.248+09:00">这样，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:06:48.558+09:00">人的天性怎能够不受伤害呢？</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T17:59:33.309+09:00">【1.2.4】万人手持弓箭，同时射向同一个箭靶，【1万人操弓共射一招：原作“万人操弓共射其一招”，“其”字乃衍文，当删。招：谆(zhbn)的，就像现在所说的箭靶上的红心。万人共射同一箭靶，即使没有高超射艺，也定必命中。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:12:19.509+09:00">箭靶没有不被射中的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:13:33.644+09:00">万物明美，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:13:51.955+09:00">如果都用来伤害一个生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:14:11.84+09:00">这个生命没有不受伤害的；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:14:25.644+09:00">如果万物都用来帮助生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:14:52.251+09:00">这个生命没有不长寿的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:15:15.563+09:00">所以，圣人制约万物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:16:09.164+09:00">是为了保全自己的生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:21:56.026+09:00">生命完全没有损伤，人的精神便会平和，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:17:34.812+09:00">眼睛明亮，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:17:30.683+09:00">耳朵聪敏，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:22:00.753+09:00">鼻子敏锐，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:22:10.268+09:00">口齿伶俐，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:22:18.333+09:00">全身的筋骨就能舒展顺畅。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T18:02:35.422+09:00">像这样的人，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T18:02:37.961+09:00">不用说话就有信义，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:22:44.053+09:00">不用谋划就会举止得当，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:35:06.796+09:00">不用思考就有所得； 【“不言而信"三句：《淮南子•原道》有相同的句子，之后有“不为而成” 一句。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:23:11.392+09:00">他们的精神流行于天地之间，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:23:25.026+09:00">覆盖了整个宇宙。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:35:44.03+09:00">对于外物，他们无不接纳，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:35:56.763+09:00">也无不包容，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:36:07.102+09:00">就像天地一样；</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:36:24.09+09:00">他们上为天子而不骄傲，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:44:41.322+09:00">下为布衣而不忧闷。  【惽(mèn )：意思与“闷”相同。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-06T06:47:26.399+09:00">这样的人，可以称得上是德行完美的人。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
